## Decision Matrix: CSRF Protection Requirements

| Authentication Method | Storage Location | CSRF Risk | CSRF Protection Required | XSS Risk |
|----------------------|------------------|-----------|--------------------------|----------|
| Session Cookie | Server-side session, cookie sent automatically | ✅ HIGH | ✅ YES | ❌ Low (HttpOnly cookies) |
| JWT in Cookie | Cookie (auto-sent) | ✅ HIGH | ✅ YES | ❌ Low (HttpOnly cookies) |
| JWT in localStorage | Client-side storage, manual header inclusion | ❌ None | ❌ NO | ✅ HIGH |
| JWT in sessionStorage | Client-side storage, manual header inclusion | ❌ None | ❌ NO | ✅ HIGH |
| Mobile App (JWT in secure storage) | App keychain/keystore | ❌ None | ❌ NO | ❌ None (no browser JS) |
| HTTP Basic Auth | Authorization header (manual) | ❌ None | ❌ NO | ⚠️ Medium (if credentials in JS) |

